        {
            "+content": "Tsuihō Sareta ... Ōka Suru. Ore wa Buki dake janaku, Arayuru Mono ni \"Kyōka Point\" o Fuyo Dekiru shi, Ore no Ishi de itsu demo Kōka o Kaijo Dekiru kedo, Nokotta Hito-tachi Daijōbu?",
